# L §3.2: "adding two currencies is refused (N-202)" (LOAD-UNIT at load).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "a source"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
unit hour "godzina"

input a: money PLN
input e: money EUR

ask q1: a + e
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT ...
